# type-seed.dl — written by the dl VS Code extension (dl.typeSeed / cmd+alt+t).
# Facts only; `rel type_seed(seed: text).` is declared in flow-panel.dl so an
# absent file never breaks the program. Each fact seeds the "Type neighbors"
# panel preset (the seed's impls + type references, bounded 1 hop). Clear with
# dl.clearTypeSeeds (cmd+alt+shift+t).
